WEBVTT

00:01.930 --> 00:06.380
I thought that during the School Festival, Ayako-san and I connected, heart-to-heart.

00:06.380 --> 00:07.940
But after that, I...

00:08.560 --> 00:09.930
I-I’m sorry!

00:09.930 --> 00:12.930
You really expected me to, didn’t you?

00:13.390 --> 00:16.110
It hurts too much to say any more.

00:16.110 --> 00:18.070
Please just watch the episode.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:53.680 --> 01:56.570
She was strong.

02:18.160 --> 02:20.580
She brought out every ounce of my brother’s strength,

02:20.580 --> 02:22.480
and yet, she still stood.

02:44.310 --> 02:48.660
She was beautiful, noble, and pure...

02:49.560 --> 02:54.640
The Witch Beatrice, of the East.

02:58.190 --> 03:02.250
You were far stronger back then.

03:02.250 --> 03:05.200
But I’ve become strong, as well.

03:06.090 --> 03:09.100
I shall demonstrate my strength

03:09.100 --> 03:11.460
not only by executing my brother’s orders,

03:11.460 --> 03:14.640
but by destroying you.

03:14.640 --> 03:16.210
Boss...

03:17.130 --> 03:20.720
Um, we’re really standing out here.

03:21.260 --> 03:23.340
I can’t do this anymore.

03:30.540 --> 03:34.540
Please watch over me, Brother.

03:35.750 --> 03:40.670
Ice Maiden

03:42.340 --> 03:44.080
Mamoru, here’s some sugar.

03:54.780 --> 03:55.890
This is flour!

03:55.890 --> 04:00.090
I thought using salt would be too normal.

04:00.090 --> 04:02.040
Neither one is normal.

04:03.220 --> 04:06.010
Ayako-san didn’t pick you up this morning.

04:07.060 --> 04:10.100
I guess she’s busy.

04:10.100 --> 04:13.350
And I feel bad having her pick me up every day.

04:14.210 --> 04:15.000
What?

04:15.000 --> 04:16.900
I hope things are OK.

04:18.240 --> 04:21.780
A woman’s heart is like an autumn sky!

04:22.380 --> 04:23.880
A-And how is that?

04:23.880 --> 04:26.450
A perfect day for washing!

04:26.450 --> 04:29.490
Put out your underwear, Mamoru.

04:31.930 --> 04:33.890
That has nothing to do with it...

04:34.560 --> 04:37.230
<i>Jeez, Mom and Itsumi both...</i>

04:37.230 --> 04:41.270
<i>It’s been a week since she stopped
driving me to and from school.</i>

04:41.270 --> 04:44.440
<i>I’d be lying if I said it didn’t worry me.</i>

04:44.440 --> 04:47.070
Hey, Yoshimura Mamoru-kun!

04:50.390 --> 04:53.600
Heading to school alone, I see.

04:54.560 --> 04:59.380
So the rumor that Ayako-san got sick of you is true?

05:00.230 --> 05:02.610
She spent all that time helping you study,

05:02.610 --> 05:04.860
and you got a horrible score on your test?

05:05.280 --> 05:08.940
Or did she find out about how you can’t sleep

05:08.940 --> 05:11.560
without the favorite towel you’ve had since childhood?

05:12.060 --> 05:13.930
How did you find out about those things?

05:16.130 --> 05:19.700
Don’t get so down, Yoshimura Mamoru.

05:19.700 --> 05:23.330
You’re the one who’s making me down, Abiko-sempai.

05:23.330 --> 05:27.180
I have a present for you!

05:27.180 --> 05:29.610
Love DNA, Works for One Month Only

05:27.760 --> 05:28.720
Here you go.

05:32.660 --> 05:34.640
Hi-yo, Silver!

05:39.350 --> 05:40.720
<i>It’s OK, it’s OK.</i>

05:40.720 --> 05:42.190
<i>Even without her picking me up...</i>

05:48.830 --> 05:52.430
<i>I can still see her at Student Council.</i>

05:56.370 --> 05:57.540
Shh...

06:06.670 --> 06:08.460
Let’s get started.

06:12.570 --> 06:15.310
Student Council Ski Trip

06:18.140 --> 06:19.540
A trip?

06:19.540 --> 06:20.500
With everyone?

06:20.500 --> 06:23.730
The Sudou family owns a villa.

06:23.730 --> 06:27.280
Every year, we go skiing there.

06:27.280 --> 06:29.280
That’s why Yagi-sempai...

06:29.690 --> 06:31.280
I am Schetmann.

06:31.280 --> 06:33.820
They say we’ll hunt the food.

06:33.820 --> 06:35.810
I can’t wait.

06:35.810 --> 06:41.750
I haven’t seen you two together
in a while, so it’ll be fun.

06:42.970 --> 06:44.140
That’s right.

06:51.320 --> 06:52.440
Ayako-san!

06:52.440 --> 06:53.370
Mamoru...

06:53.370 --> 06:55.220
You look tired.

06:55.220 --> 06:57.180
N-Not at all.

06:57.180 --> 07:00.600
They say sleeping helps you grow, right?

07:01.200 --> 07:03.440
I’m in a growth phase!

07:03.440 --> 07:06.900
Not that I’m saying you’re small or anything!

07:06.900 --> 07:07.710
OK.

07:07.710 --> 07:08.940
Yeah...

07:08.940 --> 07:11.240
I may be a little busy.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.810
But just a little.

07:12.810 --> 07:13.350
A little.

07:13.350 --> 07:14.860
Are you OK?

07:14.860 --> 07:17.020
If there’s anything I can do...

07:17.020 --> 07:18.080
It’s just fine!

07:18.080 --> 07:21.960
It’s got nothing... Nothing to do with you!

07:21.960 --> 07:23.960
Nothing to do with you...

07:25.010 --> 07:26.930
OK, see you tomorrow!

07:32.440 --> 07:37.810
<i>Is Ayako-san hiding something from me?</i>

07:38.170 --> 07:40.770
<i>The rumor that Ayako-san got sick of you...</i>

07:41.120 --> 07:42.940
<i>I hope things are OK...</i>

07:43.330 --> 07:47.110
<i>It’s got nothing... Nothing to do with you!</i>

07:48.860 --> 07:52.760
<i>The School Festival was so fun, too.</i>

07:54.540 --> 07:59.450
<i>I felt her emotions flow into me.</i>

08:00.590 --> 08:03.750
<i>It was warm and peaceful.</i>

08:03.750 --> 08:07.950
<i>I thought that was what it
meant to be one with someone.</i>

08:20.270 --> 08:21.740
<i>It’s the same.</i>

08:27.000 --> 08:28.460
Good morning.

08:28.460 --> 08:32.260
Oh, thank you for coming all this way.

08:32.260 --> 08:35.430
We’ll drive very safely on the way.

08:35.430 --> 08:37.650
Goodbye, then.

08:37.650 --> 08:39.450
Bye!

08:40.830 --> 08:43.170
Itsumi, why are you...

08:43.170 --> 08:46.650
They invited me!

08:47.870 --> 08:51.880
Your sister is our friend.

08:51.880 --> 08:55.490
We got to know Itsumi-san at the School Fair.

08:55.490 --> 08:59.520
I’ve got the official Beatrice Student Council sticker, too!

08:59.520 --> 09:00.590
See?

09:01.180 --> 09:02.770
When did you...

09:02.770 --> 09:04.710
Come on!

09:04.710 --> 09:06.040
Coming!

09:06.040 --> 09:07.400
Take care!

09:08.180 --> 09:10.330
Take care, all right?

09:10.780 --> 09:12.250
Good morning!

09:12.820 --> 09:13.860
Bye!

09:15.240 --> 09:16.520
See you!

09:16.520 --> 09:19.280
<i>Doggie’s crying out back, in the field.</i>

09:20.060 --> 09:24.150
<i>Honest gramps dug a hole</i>

09:24.150 --> 09:32.300
<i>and found big coins, little coins... Jingle, jingle.</i>

09:32.320 --> 09:35.360
My, she’s really relaxed.

09:35.360 --> 09:37.350
Lately, she’s been sleeping a lot.

09:37.350 --> 09:40.450
OK, time for a shot of her afternoon nap.

09:40.450 --> 09:42.060
Make sure the flash is off.

09:42.060 --> 09:43.770
Of course!

09:43.770 --> 09:45.070
Jeez...

09:46.080 --> 09:50.910
<i>I hope during this trip, we can get back to how we were.</i>

09:58.890 --> 10:01.820
OK, let’s have one without Ayako!

10:01.820 --> 10:03.400
A King Game!

10:12.930 --> 10:15.100
I can’t believe it.

10:15.100 --> 10:17.860
The Beatrice I know would never

10:17.860 --> 10:22.940
expose herself to attack by falling asleep in public.

10:22.940 --> 10:28.050
And she’s lying on a boy so indecently...

10:28.050 --> 10:30.170
Sleeping together, huh?

10:30.170 --> 10:32.230
All lovey-dovey, huh? Damn it!

10:32.230 --> 10:33.420
Lovey-dovey?

10:33.420 --> 10:37.240
What does that mean in Japanese?

10:37.990 --> 10:40.750
The word “lovey-dovey” often came up,

10:40.750 --> 10:46.090
as I asked people about
Yoshimura Mamoru and Takasu Ayako.

10:46.090 --> 10:49.150
Lovey-dovey is a word that describes couples

10:49.150 --> 10:51.570
who think they’re better than everyone else!

11:02.440 --> 11:04.350
Yoshimura Mamoru.

11:09.290 --> 11:10.730
Hello.

11:10.730 --> 11:13.800
There’s a lot I’d like to ask you.

11:13.800 --> 11:14.980
Um, you are...

11:16.550 --> 11:20.820
You, who stir-fried the heart of the Witch Beatrice.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.930
Stir-fried?

11:20.400 --> 11:21.930
Correction

11:20.400 --> 11:21.930
Stole

11:21.530 --> 11:23.540
Many, many things...

11:24.700 --> 11:29.430
Alone, away from the Witch Beatrice.

11:30.640 --> 11:35.380
Before that, may I say something?

11:35.380 --> 11:36.230
Go ahead.

11:36.230 --> 11:38.200
Uh, well...

11:40.560 --> 11:42.630
This is the boy’s room.

11:55.780 --> 11:57.940
What was that about?

12:02.960 --> 12:04.950
What was that for?

12:04.950 --> 12:07.380
I haven’t paid off the loan yet!

12:07.380 --> 12:08.890
Ayako-san?

12:08.890 --> 12:10.310
What’s wrong?

12:10.310 --> 12:14.200
I’ve been watching these guys
since we got on the highway.

12:14.200 --> 12:17.800
They’ve been following us.

12:18.130 --> 12:21.230
They’re probably criminals who’re mad
at me for some dumb reason or other.

12:21.230 --> 12:23.340
That’s nonsense, Witch Beatrice!

12:23.340 --> 12:27.040
We’re just upstanding passersby!

12:27.040 --> 12:28.260
That’s right!

12:28.260 --> 12:31.400
I bet they call you the Angel of Death
because you’re so distrustful.

12:31.400 --> 12:34.980
For a passerby, you know a lot about me.

12:38.780 --> 12:40.990
It’s gonna blow.

12:44.950 --> 12:46.250
Man, that was weird.

12:46.250 --> 12:47.790
Anyway, let’s get going.

12:47.790 --> 12:49.290
U-Um...

12:49.290 --> 12:50.430
What?

12:50.430 --> 12:53.920
There was a girl asking me about you, too...

12:53.920 --> 12:56.960
Oh yeah, there are tons.

12:56.960 --> 12:59.630
You can’t worry about them.

13:00.620 --> 13:02.930
Was she a criminal?

13:10.020 --> 13:11.480
We’re sorry.

13:11.480 --> 13:12.810
Boss...

13:14.260 --> 13:15.440
It stinks!

13:17.170 --> 13:18.420
Don’t lick me!

13:18.420 --> 13:20.510
Especially not with that smell!

13:22.190 --> 13:25.580
<i>Brother, I won’t be beaten.</i>

13:25.580 --> 13:29.160
<i>I will endure this humiliation and...</i>

13:32.600 --> 13:34.540
Play-with-Pigs
Petting Zoo

13:34.910 --> 13:37.400
Three... Two... Go!

13:46.430 --> 13:48.300
Brother!

13:48.300 --> 13:49.910
You’re good at this!

13:53.520 --> 13:55.000
This way!

13:56.290 --> 13:58.060
This is so fun!

14:07.190 --> 14:09.030
I’m a bit tired.

14:09.030 --> 14:11.390
I’ll wait here.

14:11.960 --> 14:14.230
Then, I’ll stay with you.

14:14.230 --> 14:15.470
Nope.

14:15.470 --> 14:16.940
You go have fun.

14:22.720 --> 14:24.210
Mamoru, what’s wrong?

14:24.880 --> 14:26.950
Worried?

14:26.950 --> 14:29.520
You wanna go?

14:29.520 --> 14:32.760
You can’t leave Ayako alone?

14:34.020 --> 14:36.610
No... Um, I...

14:36.610 --> 14:42.080
It’s a bit hot, so I’m gonna drop off my hat.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.830
Then I’ll take it for you!

14:45.790 --> 14:46.600
Itsumi...

14:49.950 --> 14:51.700
Got the shot.

14:58.380 --> 15:00.900
I still smell pig.

15:00.900 --> 15:03.400
Are you saying the boss stinks?

15:03.400 --> 15:04.610
No!

15:04.610 --> 15:08.800
If it comes from her, even pig
smells like toilet freshener...

15:08.800 --> 15:09.830
Toilet.

15:09.830 --> 15:10.880
Boss!

15:10.880 --> 15:13.260
Saburou, you bastard!

15:13.710 --> 15:18.040
You mean a boy’s toilet or a girl’s toilet?

15:24.090 --> 15:25.230
Lock on.

15:27.650 --> 15:29.150
Oh, sorry.

15:36.540 --> 15:40.170
<i>Daughter, listen to me.</i>

15:40.170 --> 15:44.140
<i>Don’t fall for a mountain man...</i>

15:47.060 --> 15:51.510
The Witch Beatrice I know would never ski.

15:55.320 --> 15:59.770
I’m sure she’s off, training alone.

16:10.590 --> 16:11.880
Boss?

16:12.960 --> 16:14.240
Someone’s coming.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.130
Let’s go.

16:18.330 --> 16:22.070
Um, Mamoru’s room was which one?

16:33.040 --> 16:36.090
Oh, no. What’s that doing here?

16:49.620 --> 16:51.110
President?

16:51.110 --> 16:54.970
Last time we were here was just after the duel.

16:54.970 --> 16:55.930
D-Duel?

16:55.930 --> 16:56.820
Whose duel?

16:57.120 --> 17:00.140
The Witch Beatrice against the Dark Lord of Prussia.

17:00.140 --> 17:04.380
Ayako-san dueled the Dark Lord of Prussia?

17:04.890 --> 17:07.630
I’ve heard that name somewhere...

17:07.630 --> 17:11.080
Yes. His real name is Johan Dieter Rudiger.

17:12.530 --> 17:14.590
He’s known as the Dark Lord of Prussia because

17:14.590 --> 17:17.900
he’s one of the planet’s most
powerful beatrice users.

17:18.510 --> 17:20.010
The duel ended in a draw, though.

17:23.180 --> 17:25.860
Ayako-san fought someone that amazing...

17:25.860 --> 17:30.900
I invited her here to rest and recover.

17:31.990 --> 17:35.320
But her eyes were bloodshot the entire time...

17:37.240 --> 17:40.720
She seems to be relaxing this time, though.

17:47.210 --> 17:52.740
<i>There’s still a lot I don’t know about her.</i>

17:53.560 --> 17:57.460
<i>That’s why... That’s why I get uneasy.</i>

17:58.300 --> 18:00.100
Yoshimura, this way.

18:01.870 --> 18:04.750
Why not let her do a tarot reading
to discover your compatibility with her?

18:06.000 --> 18:10.740
Youko-san was tutored by a fortune teller in the street for two whole hours!

18:11.200 --> 18:12.840
Two whole hours...

18:12.840 --> 18:16.250
Time has nothing to do with what’s been learned.

18:16.250 --> 18:17.950
That’s odd.

18:19.290 --> 18:21.490
This card is Death.

18:21.490 --> 18:23.590
No... Next is the important one.

18:26.910 --> 18:28.430
What is this?

18:29.390 --> 18:30.170
Accidents.

18:30.170 --> 18:31.230
Depression.

18:32.100 --> 18:36.200
A deep despair will visit you both.

18:38.330 --> 18:40.720
I-I’m sure it’s nothing to worry about.

18:40.720 --> 18:43.330
Yeah, she only learned for two hours.

18:43.330 --> 18:46.640
They say you need three hours, at a minimum!

18:54.150 --> 18:55.600
What’s wrong?

18:56.100 --> 18:59.020
I’m going back to my room.

18:59.020 --> 19:00.860
O-OK...

19:18.490 --> 19:19.770
Mamoru?

19:20.960 --> 19:22.230
Ayako-san...

19:24.340 --> 19:27.020
Do you have some time?

19:28.310 --> 19:31.810
I want to talk to you about something,
away from everyone else.

19:32.220 --> 19:35.250
I’ll wait at the sky lift.

19:35.250 --> 19:35.940
See you.

19:42.440 --> 19:44.170
Talk to me about?

19:47.100 --> 19:50.630
<i>I wonder what she’s going to tell me.</i>

19:50.630 --> 19:54.890
<i>But this is the first chance I’ve had
to talk to her in a while.</i>

19:54.890 --> 19:55.800
<i>I know.</i>

19:55.800 --> 19:57.680
<i>I’ll talk to her and...</i>

19:58.930 --> 19:59.930
That’s odd.

20:07.660 --> 20:08.870
No way...

20:23.110 --> 20:25.260
Why? What happened?

21:00.300 --> 21:01.550
Boss! Boss!

21:02.110 --> 21:03.490
Your nose...

21:03.490 --> 21:04.610
I’m sorry.

21:06.370 --> 21:08.470
Thank you.

21:08.470 --> 21:10.890
Boss, you don’t need to return it.

21:11.360 --> 21:13.430
Th-Then give it to me, Jirou.

21:13.430 --> 21:15.320
You want her snot?

21:15.320 --> 21:17.250
Say what you want!

21:17.250 --> 21:18.830
I’m a pervert!

21:20.040 --> 21:22.130
It’s time.

21:30.350 --> 21:34.430
I thought I’d made my beatrice utterly undetectable.

21:36.090 --> 21:39.520
Yoshimura Mamoru, could you be...

21:40.840 --> 21:43.990
B-Boss, your nose again.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.450 --> 23:17.890
Lately, the animal I think about the most is

23:17.890 --> 23:20.170
the anaconda, I suppose.

23:20.620 --> 23:25.210
If you get close, it’ll swallow you up, not even bothering to chew.

23:25.760 --> 23:29.300
I bet it enjoys how you feel, going down its throat.

23:30.230 --> 23:32.150
Evil and greedy...

23:32.150 --> 23:34.000
I know people like that.

23:34.440 --> 23:37.770
For now, if our anaconda attacks,

23:37.770 --> 23:40.330
the best way to deal with it is to give it Yoshimura Mamoru...

23:40.330 --> 23:42.710
Next time: Meant for You.
